###############################################################################
#                                                                             #
#              WALLET DASHBOARD — COMPLETE API TEST FILE                      #
#              FriendsTogether Backend                                        #
#                                                                             #
#  HOW TO USE:                                                                #
#  1. IntelliJ IDEA: File > Open > Select this file                          #
#     Click the green ▶ play button next to any request                       #
#                                                                             #
#  2. VS Code: Install "REST Client" extension by Huachao Mao                #
#     Click "Send Request" above any request                                  #
#                                                                             #
#  IMPORTANT:                                                                 #
#  - First run STEP 1 (Login) to get your access token                        #
#  - Copy the accessToken from the response                                   #
#  - Replace {{token}} with your actual token in all other requests           #
#                                                                             #
#  BASE URL: http://localhost:8080                                            #
#                                                                             #
###############################################################################


###############################################################################
# VARIABLES
###############################################################################
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = PASTE_YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE



###############################################################################
#                                                                             #
#    ███████╗████████╗███████╗██████╗      ██╗                                #
#    ██╔════╝╚══██╔══╝██╔════╝██╔══██╗    ███║                                #
#    ███████╗   ██║   █████╗  ██████╔╝    ╚██║                                #
#    ╚════██║   ██║   ██╔══╝  ██╔═══╝      ██║                                #
#    ███████║   ██║   ███████╗██║           ██║                                #
#    ╚══════╝   ╚═╝   ╚══════╝╚═╝           ╚═╝                                #
#                                                                             #
#    LOGIN — Get Access Token                                                 #
#                                                                             #
###############################################################################


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. LOGIN (Run this FIRST to get your JWT token)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 
### INPUT:
###   email    → Your registered email
###   password → Your password
### 
### EXPECTED RESPONSE (200 OK):
### {
###   "accessToken": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.xxxxx.yyyyy",
###   "tokenType": "Bearer",
###   "username": "your_username",
###   "expiresIn": 86400
### }
### 
### ACTION: Copy the accessToken value and replace {{token}} above
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "your_email@example.com",
  "password": "your_password"
}



###############################################################################
#                                                                             #
#    ███████╗████████╗███████╗██████╗     ██████╗                             #
#    ██╔════╝╚══██╔══╝██╔════╝██╔══██╗    ╚════██╗                            #
#    ███████╗   ██║   █████╗  ██████╔╝     █████╔╝                            #
#    ╚════██║   ██║   ██╔══╝  ██╔═══╝     ██╔═══╝                             #
#    ███████║   ██║   ███████╗██║          ███████╗                            #
#    ╚══════╝   ╚═╝   ╚══════╝╚═╝          ╚══════╝                            #
#                                                                             #
#    WALLET BALANCE — Current Coins                                           #
#                                                                             #
###############################################################################


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. GET WALLET BALANCE
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 
### ENDPOINT:  GET /api/wallet/balance
### AUTH:      Bearer Token (required)
### 
### WHAT IT DOES:
###   Reads user_wallets table → returns current coin balance.
###   Single row, O(1) lookup on unique index.
### 
### EXPECTED RESPONSE (200 OK):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Wallet balance fetched successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "coins": 247,
###     "status": "ACTIVE",
###     "lifetimeRechargedCoins": 0,
###     "lastTransactionAt": "2026-07-09T14:46:00"
###   },
###   "timestamp": 1720520760000
### }
### 
### POSSIBLE ERRORS:
###   401 → Token missing or expired
###   404 → Wallet not found for user
###   403 → Wallet is FROZEN / BLOCKED / CLOSED
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



###############################################################################
#                                                                             #
#    ███████╗████████╗███████╗██████╗     ██████╗                             #
#    ██╔════╝╚══██╔══╝██╔════╝██╔══██╗    ╚════██╗                            #
#    ███████╗   ██║   █████╗  ██████╔╝     █████╔╝                            #
#    ╚════██║   ██║   ██╔══╝  ██╔═══╝      ╚═══██╗                            #
#    ███████║   ██║   ███████╗██║          ██████╔╝                            #
#    ╚══════╝   ╚═╝   ╚══════╝╚═╝          ╚═════╝                            #
#                                                                             #
#    WALLET SUMMARY — Dashboard Composite                                     #
#                                                                             #
###############################################################################


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. GET WALLET SUMMARY (Dashboard Composite)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 
### ENDPOINT:  GET /api/wallet/summary
### AUTH:      Bearer Token (required)
### 
### WHAT IT DOES:
###   Returns balance + last 5 recent transactions in ONE call.
###   Frontend ko 2 alag API calls nahi karni padti.
### 
###   Queries:
###   1. user_wallets → currentBalance
###   2. wallet_transactions → top 5 recent
### 
### EXPECTED RESPONSE (200 OK):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Wallet summary fetched successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "balance": {
###       "coins": 247,
###       "status": "ACTIVE",
###       "lifetimeRechargedCoins": 0,
###       "lastTransactionAt": "2026-07-09T14:46:00"
###     },
###     "recentTransactions": [
###       {
###         "transactionNumber": "TXN-SEED-1-12345678",
###         "amount": 247,
###         "type": "CREDIT",
###         "reason": "WELCOME_BONUS",
###         "description": "Welcome bonus - 247 coins credited",
###         "balanceAfter": 247,
###         "createdAt": "2026-07-09T14:46:00"
###       }
###     ]
###   },
###   "timestamp": 1720520760000
### }
### 
### POSSIBLE ERRORS:
###   401 → Token missing or expired
###   404 → Wallet not found for user
###   403 → Wallet is FROZEN / BLOCKED / CLOSED
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



###############################################################################
#                                                                             #
#    ███████╗████████╗███████╗██████╗     ██╗  ██╗                            #
#    ██╔════╝╚══██╔══╝██╔════╝██╔══██╗    ██║  ██║                            #
#    ███████╗   ██║   █████╗  ██████╔╝    ███████║                            #
#    ╚════██║   ██║   ██╔══╝  ██╔═══╝     ╚════██║                            #
#    ███████║   ██║   ███████╗██║               ██║                            #
#    ╚══════╝   ╚═╝   ╚══════╝╚═╝               ╚═╝                            #
#                                                                             #
#    TRANSACTION HISTORY — Paginated                                          #
#                                                                             #
###############################################################################


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4a. GET TRANSACTION HISTORY — Default (Page 0, Size 20)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 
### ENDPOINT:  GET /api/wallet/transactions
### AUTH:      Bearer Token (required)
### PARAMS:    page (default 0), size (default 20, max 50), type (optional)
### 
### WHAT IT DOES:
###   Returns paginated wallet transaction history.
###   Latest transactions first (ORDER BY created_at DESC).
### 
### EXPECTED RESPONSE (200 OK):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Transaction history fetched successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "content": [
###       {
###         "transactionNumber": "TXN-SEED-1-12345678",
###         "amount": 247,
###         "type": "CREDIT",
###         "reason": "WELCOME_BONUS",
###         "description": "Welcome bonus - 247 coins credited",
###         "balanceAfter": 247,
###         "createdAt": "2026-07-09T14:46:00"
###       }
###     ],
###     "pageable": { ... },
###     "totalElements": 1,
###     "totalPages": 1,
###     "size": 20,
###     "number": 0,
###     "first": true,
###     "last": true,
###     "empty": false
###   },
###   "timestamp": 1720520760000
### }
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4b. GET TRANSACTION HISTORY — Custom Pagination
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 
### Page 0, Size 5 — sirf 5 transactions per page
### 
### EXPECTED: Same structure as 4a, but with size=5
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/transactions?page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4c. GET TRANSACTION HISTORY — Filter by CREDIT only
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 
### Sirf CREDIT transactions (purchases, rewards, bonuses)
### 
### EXPECTED: Same paginated structure, but only type="CREDIT" entries
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/transactions?type=CREDIT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4d. GET TRANSACTION HISTORY — Filter by DEBIT only
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 
### Sirf DEBIT transactions (gifts sent, admin deductions)
### 
### EXPECTED: Same paginated structure, but only type="DEBIT" entries
### NOTE: If no debits exist yet, content will be empty array []
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/transactions?type=DEBIT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4e. GET TRANSACTION HISTORY — Page 2
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 
### Second page of transactions
### NOTE: If total transactions < 20, this will return empty content
### 
### EXPECTED: "number": 1 (0-indexed), "first": false
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/transactions?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4f. GET TRANSACTION HISTORY — Max Size (50)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 
### Size > 50 automatically capped to 50 by controller
### This tests that size=100 actually returns max 50
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/transactions?page=0&size=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



